## Available skills

| Skill | Command | Purpose |
|-------|---------|---------|
| feature | `/feature <description>` | Risk intake → plan → build → review |
| fix-bug | `/fix-bug <symptom>` | Root cause → fix → verify → commit |
| review-checklist | `/review-checklist [PR]` | correctness → tests → scale → readability → security → scope; numbered findings, each with a failing case |
| checkpoint | `/checkpoint` | Progress vs plan + quality gates |
| sync-memory | `/sync-memory` | Pull latest + summarise the new commits, flag overlaps |

## Hooks (auto-registered)

| Hook | Trigger | Does |
|------|---------|------|
| `commit-quality-gate.sh` | Before `git commit` | Block secrets, debug artifacts |
| `branch-guard.sh` | Before `git push` | Block direct pushes to dev/stag/prod and force/delete pushes to protected branches (core, always on) |
| `scope-gate.sh` | Each prompt | Flag high-risk patterns |

